.worktrees/

# World Cup: large/regenerable artifacts. Kept out of git:
#   fit/  — 900MB+ Stan fit + extracted draws (regenerable via scripts/wc/fit.R)
#   raw/  — bulk international-results CSV (re-downloaded; updates through the tournament)
#   forecast.html — self-contained render (regenerable via wc_render_html())
# Tracked: data/wc/structure/ (groups, FIFA Annex-C table, Icelandic names) +
# data/publish/football/world/ (the JSON data contract metill-platform consumes).
data/wc/fit/
data/wc/raw/
data/wc/forecast.html

# Quarto report renders (regenerable from .qmd; can be multi-MB self-contained HTML)
docs/reports/*.html
docs/reports/*_files/

# Model-quality dashboard: JSON contract + render (regenerable via scripts/0Nd_dashboard.R)
data/dashboard/
docs/dashboard/*.html
docs/dashboard/*_files/

# Isolated "what-if" replay tree (data/publish_replay/2026-05-15/, etc.)
# — produced by scripts/0Nr_replay.R --publish-to, never meant to ship
data/publish_replay/

# Backtest artefacts (regenerable via scripts/0Nb_backtest.R)
data/backtest/

# Unattended placer runtime (local only)
data/.auto_place.lock
data/AUTO_PLACE_DISABLED
data/health/placement_status.json
